IMPORTANT RAFT INTERVIEW POINT
------------------------------
Do NOT say that every client request is independently sent to all 3 nodes.

Correct flow:
Client -> Leader -> Leader log -> Follower replication -> Majority ACK
-> Commit -> State-machine application.

Therefore:
- Leader normally receives client traffic.
- Followers should show replication / AppendEntries / ACK / state-machine activity.
- Follower client-request metrics do not need to equal leader metrics.
- A 3-node Raft cluster remains available after losing one node because
  2/3 nodes still form a majority.


